    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1192" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδελφ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, fem. of
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδελφός</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sister</i>, Trag., E <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				866
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμοπατρία ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Georg.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				320.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>: 
				Ion.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδελφ-εή</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.56
			</span></i>, al.; 
				Ep.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδελφ-ειή</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				1.30
			</span></i>; 
				Dor.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδελφ-εά</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				7.4
			</span></i>, and in lyr, passages of Trag., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				160
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OC</u>
				535
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>kinswoman</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jb.</u>
				42.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> term of
			endearment, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ca.</u>
				4.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>To.</u>
				5.21
			</span></i>; applied to a wife, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				744.1
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>, etc.:—as a title, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βερενίκη ἡ ἀ. καὶ γυνὴ αὐτοῦ</span> (of
			a cousin) <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				60.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>:—<i>sister</i> (as a fellow
			Christian), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
				16.1
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
